# What a `vercel deploy` run from this directory does not upload. A Git deploy
# already leaves out everything .gitignore does; this keeps a CLI upload the
# same, .env above all. Keep src/, web/ and api/.
.venv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tests
evals
eval-runs
drills
scripts
call-reports
recordings
*.log
**/*.log
validation-report.*
*.csv
*.md
